column10:
Dr. Chakrapani B.S. is a renowned and highly accomplished Best Cardiologist in Bangalore with years of expertise and exceptional skills. As a consultant in Cardiology, he is recognised as a valuable contributor to the medical community at Manipal Hospitals, Old Airport &nbsp;Bangalore. His excellent patient care and commitment have earned him a reputation as one of the leading practitioners in his field today. Dr. Chakrapani B.S. specialises in Interventional Cardiology and Invasive and Non-invasive Cardiology. He is a Diplomate of the National Board in Internal Medicine from JJM Medical College &amp; National Board of Examination, New Delhi. He has performed more than 6000 invasive cardiac procedures. He has been in the first group to start the era of Primary Angioplasty for Acute Myocardial Infraction India. He also has experience in Nuclear Cardiology from the TATA Memorial Hospital in Parel, Mumbai. Dr. Chakrapani is well known for his expertise in conducting critical surgeries and his understanding of the latest technological advancements. He is a respected leader in his field for his ability to diagnose and deliver quality patient care. He is a foremost cardiologist in Old airport road&nbsp;Bangalore.

Dr. Chakrapani B.S. passed his Bachelor of Science from Mysore University. He earned his MBBS from JJM Medical College under Mysore University in Davangere. Dr. Chakrapani enrolled in Lokmanya Tilak Hospital &amp; Municipal Medical College in Mumbai under Mumbai University to pursue his Doctor of Medicine in Cardiology. He also passed DNB in Internal Medicine from NBE - New Delhi Senior Residency in Cardiology under Nizam Institute Of Cardiology. Dr. Chakrapani is the best cardiologist in Bangalore. In 2000, he deftly managed ICCU on Wheels project in Karnataka and established the Cardiac Care Centre at Tumkur. The ICCU on Wheels projects offered a state of art facilities, including Pre-hospital thrombolysis, pulse oximeter, temporary pacemaker, ventilator and tele electro cardiology. It was a joint venture with Tumkur and Manipal Heart Foundation, Manipal Hospitals, Bangalore, and Rotary Midtown of Bangalore. This colossal project provided cost-effective cardiac care at the doorstep of rural and semi-urban populations. This project facilitates critical patient care from H2H or home to hospital, manages risk stratification, ICCU and transfers the patient to MHF for emergency coronary angioplasty and other procedures.

&nbsp;Dr. Chakrapani B.S received the CSI Group Award for his exemplary contribution to Cardiology. Dr. Chakrapani has presented and published various papers at cardiology conferences. He is a lifetime member of the Association of Physicians of India, the Indian Medical Association, the Cardiological Society of India and a member of the National Academy of Medical Sciences in New Delhi. Dr. Chakrapani is fluent in Kannada, Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, and English. His ability to converse in different languages contributes to his ability to treat and understand patients from various backgrounds and locations. If you look forward to consulting Dr. Chakrapani B S, you can book your time slot now and avail the advanced medical treatment offered by Manipal Hospitals.&nbsp;

Dr. Mallikarjun Kalashetty is an HOD &amp; Consultant - Clinical Haematology, Haemato-Oncology and Bone Marrow Transplant at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bengaluru. He has a wide variety of experience in diagnosing and treating Malignant Haematologic disorders like Acute and Chronic Leukemias, Lymphomas, Myeloma; Red Cell Disorders like Aplastic Anaemia, Nutritional Anaemia, Thalassemia, Sickle Cell Anaemia; Platelet disorders like Immune thrombocytopenic purpura-ITP; Thrombotic Disorders like Deep Vein Thrombosis and more. Dr. Kalashetty is widely known for his expertise in performing Blood &amp; Bone Marrow transplantation for various benign and malignant disorders. His skills extend to evaluating and managing haematologic complications arising in pregnancy, postpartum period, renal disorders, rheumatologic disorders, gastrointestinal disorders, neurologic disorders, and intensive care units. He is the foremost&nbsp;Consultant in Bone Marrow Transplantation Cancer Care in Old Airport Road, Bangalore.

Dr. Mallikarjun Kalashetty&#39;s pursuit of excellence is evident throughout his academic career. He followed advanced specialisation with a DM in Clinical Haematology from Seth G S Medical College and K E M Hospital in Mumbai after earning his MBBS and MD in general medicine from Jawaharlal Nehru Medical College, Belgaum. To further his training, he finished a one-year Fellowship in Bone Marrow Transplantation at Vancouver General Hospital in Canada, demonstrating his commitment to state-of-the-art transplant methods. Dr. Kalashetty returned to India and took a key position at the HCG MSR Cancer Centre at M S Ramaiah Medical College in Bangalore, where he established stem cell transplantation and clinical haematology and bone marrow transplant programmes.&nbsp;

Being a known authority in Haematology, Dr. Kalashetty has a total of 21 years of total experience and 11 years as a specialist in Haematology, making significant contributions to patient care and defining the landscape of haematological services at Manipal Hospitals and beyond. With vast knowledge and expertise in managing blood cancers in both paediatric and adult patients, he is widely regarded as a top blood cancer doctor in Bangalore by his patients.&nbsp;

Beyond his experience in medicine, Dr. Mallikarjun Kalashetty has actively published papers in national and international publications. This demonstrates his dedication to expanding medical knowledge and enhancing patient care. Dr. Mallikarjun Kalashetty has actively contributed to the scientific community outside his clinical practice. His contributions to national and international journals indicate his commitment to improving medical knowledge and staying current in his area. His pursuit of excellence and sympathetic demeanour have cemented his place as one of the best haematologists in Bangalore.

Dr. Shabber Zaveri is the Chairman, HOD, and Consultant - Surgical Oncology at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bangalore. With over 31 years of experience and an impressive academic foundation, Dr. Zaveri has earned his reputation as a trusted medical expert in the field of Surgical Oncology. Dr. Zaveri stands out as a proficient Oncologist with expertise across diverse oncological areas. His field of expertise lies in the care of Oncoplastic Breast Surgery, Head and Neck Cancers, HIPEC and PIPAC, Sarcoma, Lung and Mediastinal Tumour Resections, General Surgical Oncology, Gastrointestinal Malignancy, and Gynaec Oncology. He is a top oncology surgeon in Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Shabber Zaveri has contributed significantly to the field of oncology. He was instrumental in establishing the Department of Surgical Oncology at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bangalore in 2002. Dr. Shabber introduced the Sentinel Lymph Node Biopsy for Breast Cancer in 2004 and pioneered the Radioisotope Occult Lesion Localization (ROLL) for Breast Cancer treatment in 2005. Notably, he was among the first medical professionals in India to initiate Minimally Invasive Radio Guided Para Thyroid surgeries (MIRP). He also launched the HIPEC Program in 2013 at Manipal Hospital Bengaluru.&nbsp;

Dr. Shabber Zaveri completed his MBBS from Bangalore Medical College and Research Institute, MS in General Surgery from &nbsp;B J Medical College Ahmedabad, and M.Ch in Surgical Oncology from The Gujarat Cancer and Research Institute. Notably, he has secured fellowships in Robotic Surgery at Hackensack Medical Center, New Jersey; Thoracic Surgery from Fachkrankenhaus, Dresden, Germany; Breast Surgical Oncology at the Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Centre, New York; Cytoreductive Surgery and HIPEC from the European Institute of Surgery, Hamburg, Germany and PIPAC from St. Elizebeth Hospital, Germany.

In addition to his fellowships, Dr. Shabber Zaveri maintains active memberships in several esteemed medical associations. These include the Association of Surgeons of India, IASO Indian Association of Oncology, European Society of Surgical Oncology, European Society of Medical Oncology, and the American Society of Clinical Oncology, among many others. Notably, Dr. Zaveri delivered the Professor Ramdoss Oration on Radioguided Surgery in Oncology in September 2009 during the Society of Nuclear Medicine in India&#39;s Annual Conference. With a career marked by dedication, innovation, and a commitment to excellence, Dr. Shabber Zaveri is known to be one of the best surgical oncologists in Bangalore and India.

Dr. Srimanth B S is the best orthopaedic oncologist in Bangalore specialising&nbsp;in the diagnosis and treatment of musculoskeletal tumours. With a focus on primary bone and soft tissue tumours as well as metastatic bone disease, Dr. Srimanth is dedicated to providing comprehensive care to his patients. Having obtained a degree in orthopaedics, Dr. Srimanth further honed his skills in the field of orthopaedic oncology through extensive training at prestigious national and international centres of excellence. He completed his specialization at the Tata Memorial Hospital in Mumbai, renowned for its expertise in cancer care. Additionally, he gained valuable insights and experience at the Rizzoli Orthopaedic Institute in Italy and Seoul National University in South Korea.&nbsp;

Dr. Srimanth&#39;s surgical proficiency extends beyond tumour removal. He is proficient in a wide range of procedures designed not only to eradicate cancerous tumours but also to reconstruct affected areas, employing limb-sparing surgeries whenever possible to preserve limb functionality and restore mobility. His expertise encompasses paediatric sarcoma surgeries, growth-enabling limb-sparing procedures, pelvic cancer surgeries, and computer-assisted navigation techniques. With over 11 years of experience, Dr. Srimanth collaborates closely with a multidisciplinary cancer team. Working alongside medical oncologists, radiologists, radiation oncologists, and pathologists, he ensures that each patient receives a personalized treatment plan tailored to their specific needs. Embracing a team-based approach, Dr. Srimanth provides patients with a holistic platform for making informed decisions about their care.&nbsp;

Beyond his clinical practice, Dr. Srimanth actively participates in academic pursuits. He engages in clinical research, focusing on advancements in sarcoma care, to develop novel and more effective surgical treatments and limb reconstructions for sarcoma patients. Furthermore, he imparts his knowledge and expertise by training postgraduates in the fields of orthopaedics and oncology, fostering the growth of the next generation of medical professionals. With his unwavering dedication to improving patient outcomes and his commitment to advancing the field of sarcoma care, Dr. Srimanth B S continues to make significant contributions to the medical community as one of the best orthopaedician in&nbsp;Bangalore.

Dr. Vadhiraja B M is a profoundly qualified and experienced professional in Radiation Oncology. Presently filling in as the Head of the Department and Expert in Radiation Oncology, Dr. Vadhiraja has made huge commitments to the medical field. He is perceived as a leading expert in his field, with a comprehensive educational foundation and mastery of different radiation treatment techniques. Dr. Vadhiraja completed his MBBS and MD in Radiotherapy from KMC Manipal in 2000. From that point forward, he has devoted himself to advancing his knowledge and abilities in Radiation Oncology. His quest for greatness is evident in his fellowships and memberships, including the Association of Radiation Oncologists of India, the American Society of Radiation Oncology (Astro), and the European Society of Radiation Oncology (ESTRO). One of Dr Vadhiraja&#39;s subject matters lies in stereotactic radiosurgery (SRS), a precise and non-invasive radiation treatment for brain tumours and different conditions. He is likewise knowledgeable in stereotactic radiotherapy (SRT) and stereotactic body radiotherapy (SBRT/SABR), which are advanced procedures used to deliver highly designated radiation to tumours in the body. These techniques maximise treatment effectiveness while minimising damage to surrounding healthy tissues. For the same reason, he is considered the best radiation oncologist in Old Airport Road, Bangalore.&nbsp;

In addition to his expertise in stereotactic techniques, Dr. Vadhiraja is proficient in a range of other radiation therapy modalities. These include 3D conformal radiotherapy (3D CRT), intensity-modulated radiotherapy (IMRT), volumetric modulated arc therapy (VMAT), image-guided radiotherapy (IGRT), and brachytherapy (intracavitary/interstitial implants). His diverse skill set allows him to tailor treatment plans to each patient&#39;s needs, ensuring optimal outcomes. Dr. Vadhiraja is a multilingual professional who communicates effectively with patients in English, Kannada, and Hindi. This linguistic proficiency facilitates clear and comprehensive discussions, enabling patients to fully understand their treatment options and make informed decisions about their care.

Dr. Vadhiraja&#39;s reputation extends beyond the medical community. His expertise has been recognised by Manipal Hospitals, which launched the Radixact X9 with Synchrony tumour tracking technology in India under his guidance. This state-of-the-art technology provides advanced tumour-tracking capabilities during radiation therapy, enhancing treatment precision and patient outcomes. Dr. Vadhiraja&#39;s involvement in this groundbreaking endeavour demonstrates his dedication to staying at the forefront of medical advancements and providing the best possible care to his patients. In summary, Dr. Vadhiraja B M is a highly accomplished and skilled professional in the field of Radiation Oncology. With his extensive educational background, diverse expertise in radiation therapy techniques, and commitment to research and innovation, he has emerged as a leading figure in his field.&nbsp;

Dr. Rohan Augustine is a Consultant - Nephrology, Transplant Physician at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bengaluru. Having over 22 years of overall experience and 16 years as a specialist in nephrology, Dr. Rohan has extensive expertise in treating Acute Kidney Injury, Chronic Kidney Disease, Renal Transplantation, Desensitisation Procedures, ABO Incompatible Transplants, Swap Transplants, Tunnelled Cuffed Catheter Implantation, Kidney Biopsies, and Vascular Access. He demonstrates his commitment to delivering complete and cutting-edge treatment in Interventional Nephrology, including temporary Hemodialysis Catheters (IJ and Femoral), Tunneled Cuffed Catheters, as well as Performing Kidney Biopsies and Ultrasound scans. He is the foremost&nbsp;Kidney Transplant Physician Nephrologist in Oldairportroad, Bangalore.&nbsp;

With an MBBS from Jawaharlal Nehru Medical College, Belgaum, Dr. Rohan Augustine further extended his medical knowledge and pursued his MD - Internal Medicine from Kasturba Medical College, Mangalore and a DNB - Nephrology from Manipal Hospitals, Bangalore. His academic accomplishments are complemented by notable awards and achievements, such as the prestigious H.L Trivedi Gold Medal in Nephrology from the National Board of Examinations, New Delhi in 2011 and a Gold Medal in Internal Medicine from Manipal Academy of Higher Education in 2006.&nbsp;

Dr. Augustine is a prolific academic contributor with countless presentations, guest lectures, and publications, some of which include &quot;Pathological Correlation of Renal Allograft Function in Renal Transplant Recipients: A Protocol Biopsy Study&quot; and &ldquo;Comparison between Myocardial Perfusion Scan and Conventional Angiogram in Pretransplant Donor Evaluation&rdquo;. His numerous contributions to patient care, medical knowledge, and academic breakthroughs have established him as an acknowledged pioneer in nephrology, representing a holistic and compassionate approach to healthcare.

Dr. Rohan Augustine&#39;s professional affiliations show his involvement in the medical world. He is a proud member of the Karnataka Medical Council, NAK (Nephrology Association in Karnataka), ISN (Indian Society of Nephrology) and IOTS (Indian Society for Organ Transplantation). Dr Rohan Augustine provides compassionate and wise patient care practices. Dr Augustine&#39;s dedication to promoting nephrology is further evident by his active participation in conferences and seminars, which makes him one of the best nephrologists and transplant physicians in Bangalore.

Dr. Bharath Kadadi is a highly acclaimed Consultant in Hand, Wrist, and Microvascular Surgery Orthopaedics, known for his exceptional expertise and dedication to patient care. He is currently associated with Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bangalore, &nbsp;where he has been providing his invaluable services for the past 10 years. Dr. Kadadi&#39;s extensive experience and specialised training make him a trusted authority in managing various upper limb trauma cases, brachial plexus injuries, and a wide range of disorders involving the hand and wrist. Dr. Kadadi holds an MBBS degree and an MS in Orthopaedics, which has laid a strong foundation for his medical career. He has further honed his skills through fellowships in Hand and Microvascular Surgery, as well as Hand and Brachial Plexus Surgery. These specialised fellowships have equipped him with advanced techniques and approaches to effectively treat complex hand, wrist, and brachial plexus conditions. Dr. Kadadi is a member of numerous prestigious medical associations, demonstrating his dedication to professional development and information exchange. He belongs to the Asia Pacific Wrist Association (APWA), the Indian Society of Hand Surgery, the Indian Orthopaedic Association, the Karnataka Orthopaedic Association, and the Bangalore Orthopaedic Society. Dr. Bharath is the best hand surgeon in Bangalore.

In 2011, Dr. Kadadi took on the role of Director at the Bengaluru Hand Centre, where he continues to provide specialised care to patients with hand, wrist, and brachial plexus problems. His diligence, responsibility, and independence have been evident throughout his 15-year career, starting in September 2001. Dr. Kadadi is multilingual and can effectively communicate with patients in English, Kannada, Hindi, Tamil, and Malayalam. This linguistic versatility enables him to establish a strong rapport with patients from diverse backgrounds, ensuring a comfortable and personalised healthcare experience. Recognising his exceptional contributions and accomplishments, Dr. Bharath Kadadi has received numerous awards and honours. He was awarded the prestigious Robert Acland Fellowship in 2011 by the Indian Society for Surgery of the Hand, which allowed him to visit the Pulvertaft Hand unit in Derby, United Kingdom, for four weeks.

Additionally, he received the award for performing the highest number of successful surgeries in HOSMAT Hospital, Bangalore, for three consecutive years from 2004 to 2006. Dr. Kadadi&#39;s dedication and pursuit of excellence have also been acknowledged with the Best Poster Award at the National Hand Conference held in Chandigarh in 2006. Throughout his career, Dr. Bharath Kadadi has garnered a reputation for his exceptional surgical skills and comprehensive management of various conditions affecting the upper limbs. He provides consultation and treatment for tumours, rheumatoid arthritis, compressive neuropathies, upper limb trauma, deformities, spastic limb, and post-traumatic sequelae. Along with conducting minor joint replacements for osteoarthritis and rheumatoid arthritis, Dr. Kadadi is skilled in performing wrist and hand arthroscopies for sports-related injuries.&nbsp;

Dr. Hemant K Kalyan is a highly renowned Orthopaedician in Bangalore who is currently practising at Manipal Hospitals Old Airport Road as a Consultant - Orthopaedic &amp; Robotic Joint Replacement Surgery.&nbsp;With over 30 years of experience, his expertise extends to various areas of orthopaedics, including robotic hip and knee replacements,&nbsp;partial knee replacements,&nbsp; fracture surgery with minimally invasive techniques, sports injuries, and arthroscopic surgery. After completing his MBBS, Dr. Hemant Kalyan went on to pursue an MS in Orthopaedics from the University of Bombay where he was awarded the D. Ortho Gold Medal in 1989, a testament to his academic excellence. He has also obtained an International Fellowship in Arthroscopy &amp; Knee Surgery from the University of Toronto. He is a foremost consultant orthopaedic surgery in Oldairportroad, Bangalore.&nbsp;

The year 1991 marked a monumental milestone in Dr. Kalyan&#39;s illustrious career: he emerged as a pioneer, etching his name as the first Indian to be honoured with a Diploma in Sports Medicine from the esteemed Scottish Royal Colleges. He was among the pioneering Orthopaedic Surgeons who established their practice in Bengaluru in 1993, laying the foundation for the city&#39;s growing reputation as a hub for sports medicine and orthopaedic care. Dr. Hemant K Kalyan&#39;s commitment to providing exceptional care led him to conceptualise and found the renowned outpatient facility OSSICARE in 2004. He introduced advanced techniques in arthroscopy, elevating patient care.

Performing over 8,867 surgeries, including 1,416 joint replacements and 102 robotic joint replacements under his belt at Manipal Hospitals, Dr. Kalyan has left an indelible mark through his surgical expertise, educational endeavours, and groundbreaking research. His wealth of knowledge has been shared with the world through 123+&nbsp;guest lectures at esteemed national and international conferences. Dr. Kalyan has showcased his work through 18&nbsp;publications in reputable journals, disseminating valuable insights to fellow professionals. In 2018, The Economic Times recognised his exceptional contributions and featured him as one of the top 25 &lsquo;Inspiring Orthopaedicians of India&rsquo;. He is also a proud member of the AO Trauma Asia Pacific (AO TAP), Indian Association of Sports Medicine (IASM), Indian Orthopaedic Association (IOS), Indian Society of Hip and Knee Surgeons (ISHKS), Indian Arthroscopy Society (IAS), and the Indian Medical Association (IMA). Dr. Kalyan&#39;s multilingual proficiency in English, Kannada, Hindi, Gujarati, Marathi, and Tamil fosters trust and understanding among a diverse patient population. Dr. Hemant K Kalyan&#39;s dedication and passion shine through in the exceptional care he provides for which he is regarded as one of the best orthopaedic surgeons in Bangalore and India.

Dr. Amrita Rao is a renowned Gynaecologist and Infertility specialist. She is currently associated with Manipal Hospitals Old Airport Road, Bengaluru as a Consultant of Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology. She has over 25 years of rich experience in handling High-Risk Pregnancies, Polycystic ovary syndrome, Infertility Treatment (excluding IVF &amp; Male Infertility), Endoscopic Surgery, Intra-Uterine Insemination (IUI), Breast Problems, Fibroid and infertility, Laparoscopic surgery for ovarian cysts, among others.&nbsp;

Dr. Amrita Rao renders female infertility treatment through state-of-the-art medical technology. She has pursued many successful infertility treatments throughout her vast medical experience, which spans over two decades. She is also a specialist in Breast Surgeries, Intrauterine Insemination Treatment (IUI), Intrauterine Insemination, Ovarian Cysts Removal, and Uterine Fibroids.

Dr. Amrita Rao is also well known for her meticulous attention to detail, precise diagnoses, and caring treatment of her patients. She has dealt with several complex medical issues and put together several initiatives to empower women on various hygiene and health-related topics.&nbsp;The doctor is a proud member of the Karnataka Medical Council. In her medical career, Dr. Amrita Rao has achieved several accomplishments and has authored and co-authored many scientific publications.

Dr. Hemanandini Jayaraman is a renowned Gynaecologist in Bengaluru who is currently serving as a Consultant - Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology at Manipal Hospitals Old Airport Road, Bengaluru. She has a rich experience of more than 2 decades in Obstetrics and Gynaecology. Her area of expertise lies in Laparoscopic surgery, High-risk obstetrics, Robotic surgeries, and Vaginal hysterectomy. She specialises in performing vaginal hysterectomies and handling high-risk pregnancies.&nbsp;

The doctor got her fellowship and advanced training in robotic surgery at Buffalo, New York&#39;s Rosewell Park Cancer Institute. She is one of the few gynaecologists in India with expertise in performing robotically assisted procedures. She is a kind and empathetic doctor who helped many women dealing with pregnancy and delivery issues.&nbsp;

Dr. Hemanandini Jayaraman is also passionate about teaching and has served as a faculty member in the gynaecology department at many medical universities in India. She has delivered talks on many women&#39;s health issues like PCOS, Problems faced by new mothers, and Menstrual cups, to name a few. She has published various research articles and has multiple international publications to her credit. Her additional research interests include endoscopy, infertility, prenatal diagnosis, adolescent gynaecology, and antenatal screening.

Dr. Meena Muthiah is a well-known Consultant in Obstetrics and Gynecology at Manipal Hospitals Old Airport Road, Bangalore. She has more than 30 years of total expertise and 23 years as a specialist in performing routine and complex hysterectomies. She is among the greatest gynaecologists specializing in vaginal surgeries, urogynecology, obstetrics, gynaecology, colposcopy, and minimally invasive surgery. Additionally, she treats medical, genetic, and haematological abnormalities in pregnancy. The doctor also provides aid to pregnant women both before and after delivery. She helps to detect and treat illnesses affecting the vagina, ovaries, uterus, and breasts.&nbsp;

&nbsp;In her academic career, Dr. Meena Muthaiah completed her MBBS from Madurai Medical College in 1993 and graduated with a DNB in Obstetrics and Gynecology from Manipal Hospital in Bangalore in 2000. She is a Gold Medalist in OBG and Gynae Undergraduate High-Risk Pregnancy. She has served as a dissertation guide for trainees in the DNBE program.

She has moreover taken part in a lot of newspaper interviews. She has participated in discussions for news articles that will run in PR Newswire, Healthwise, and Amar Ujala. She is a well-known member of the Federation of Obstetric and Gynecological Societies of India (FOGSI) and the Bangalore Society of Obstetrics and Gynecology (BSOG).

Dr. Philomena Vaz is a dedicated Gynaecologist who practices as a Consultant - Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology at Manipal Hospitals on Old Airport Road, Bengaluru. She has more than 30 years of extensive experience in dealing with high-risk pregnancies, bereavement care, and well-woman clinics, in addition to doing conventional OBGYN procedures. She provides care to those struggling with Cervical Cervical, Infertility Evaluation and Treatment, Obstetrics and Antenatal Care, Intra-Uterine Insemination (IUI), Caesarean Section (C Section), and numerous other related health conditions. She is a&nbsp;top gynaecologist in Bangalore.&nbsp;

The doctor graduated from Jagadguru Jayadeva Murugarajendra Medical College (JJMMC) with her MBBS in 1975. She earned her DGO from Kasturba Medical College in 1979 before completing her MD in Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology at Jagadguru Jayadeva Murugarajendra Medical College (JJMMC) in 1984.&nbsp;Dr. Philomena Vaz has received numerous honours, including the Ayurvedacharya in 2009 and the Best Oral Presentation Award in 2014. She also received the highest grades at graduation in 2008 due to her expertise in the subject.

Dr. Philomena Vaz is a proud member of the Bangalore Society of Obstetrics &amp; Gynecology (BSOG), the Federation of Obstetric and Gynecological Societies of India (FOGSI), and the Indian Medical Association (IMA). Additionally, she is a fellow of the National Academy of Medical Sciences (NAMS).

Dr. T P Rekha is an experienced Consultant in Obstetrics and Gynaecology at Manipal Hospitals Old Airport Road. She has an experience of more than 21 years as a specialist in the field of Gynaecology. Her area of expertise includes high-risk pregnancy, endoscopic gynaec surgeries: laparoscopy and hysteroscopy, colposcopy and basic OBG ultrasound, hymenoplasty, vaginal prolapse, prenatal check-up, ovary removal surgery and maternal care/ check-up, uterine fibroid treatment, complicated pregnancy treatment, vulvoscopy, Vaginal Birth After Cesarean (VBAC), and menopause counselling.

Dr. T P Rekha received her MBBS and MD in Obstetrics and Gynaecology from J.S.S. Medical College, Mysore, in 1994 and 2001, respectively. She had received specialised training in endoscopy at Bangalore&#39;s AV Hospital, which included laparoscopy and hysteroscopy. T P Rekha serves as the department&#39;s organisational secretary for the PG CME program.&nbsp;

Dr. T P Rekha is a member of the Bangalore Society of Obstetrics and Gynaecology (BSOG), the Federation of Obstetric and Gynaecological Societies of India (FOGSI), and the Society for Fetal Medicine (SOFEM). She has a 1994 Karnataka Medical Council registration. She is a proud DNB teacher and can fluently communicate in English, Hindi, and Kannada.&nbsp;

Dr. Sushal Shantakumar is a Bangalore-based renowned shoulder surgery specialist and orthopaedics consultant with impeccable educational qualifications and clinical experience. Right now, he is offering services as a Consultant for Shoulder Surgery and Orthopaedics at Manipal Hospitals, Old Airport Road, Bangalore. With over 19 years of clinical expertise, this surgeon is eminent in performing keyhole/ arthroscopic surgeries and shoulder replacement procedures. In addition, he is highly skilled in fixing complex fractures of the humerus and scapula on the shoulder joints. His passion for treating shoulder injuries caused by contact or overhead sports led him to become an expert in Sports Medicine with elite sportsmen and athletes on his patients&#39; list. He holds membership in the Indian Arthroscopy Society (IAS), International Society of Arthroscopy, Knee Surgery and Orthopaedic Sports Medicine (ISAKOS), and Bangalore Orthopaedic Society (BOS). Dr. Sushal is a top orthopaedic surgeon in Bangalore.

Dr. Sushal Shantakumar holds a remarkable fellowship at Southwest German Sports Trauma Center for Arthroscopy &amp; Sports Medicine, which is located in Stuttgart, Germany. He is also certified as a Shoulder Arthroscopy expert by Bulgaria&rsquo;s Eurovita Sports Center. Soon after completing his MBBS from MS Ramaiah Medical College in Bangalore, Dr. Shantakumar did his MS in Orthopaedics from the renowned KIMS in Hubli. He got his fellowship in Arthroscopy and Sports Medicine at German Arthroscopic Association (also known as Gesellschaft f&uuml;r Arthroskopie und Gelenkchirurgie) and AGA in Germany. With over two years of experience as an Assistant Surgeon at the German Sports Trauma Center, he shaped his skills as a specialist in Arthroplasty and Shoulder Arthroscopy. He offered services as a Consultant - Shoulder Surgery in Bangalore. Be it shoulder trauma conditions, shoulder replacement procedures, or arthroscopy procedures, this surgeon is adept in all forms of shoulder surgery. Whether it is complex fractures, AC joint dislocation, reverse shoulder replacement procedure, SLAP tears, total shoulder replacement, frozen shoulder, cuff tear-offs, or joint dislocation, he treats them all. He has performed over a hundred shoulder replacement surgical procedures and over a thousand arthroscopy or keyhole surgeries.

Apart from being a successful orthopaedic surgeon, Dr. Shantakumar also creates and runs Postgraduate Degrees for Sports Clinicians, Therapists, and Surgeons. This orthopaedics specialist is also a lecturer plus tutor influencing budding surgeons about the nuances of Sports injuries and shoulder surgery at the National level. His proficiency in languages like German, Kannada, English, Tamil, Hindi, and Telugu helps patients from every part of the country converse easily when discussing their medical conditions and symptoms. Dr. Shantakumar is a member of several reputed professional organisations at the International and National level. His paperwork is published in several leading medical journals.&nbsp;

Dr. Mahesha Vankalakunti is a Consultant - Nephropathology, HOD &ndash; Laboratory Medicine at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bengaluru. His field of expertise includes Nephro-Pathology &amp; Renal Transplant Pathology and Urologic Onco-Pathology. He is regarded for establishing the Referral Centre of Excellence in Nephro &amp; Renal Transplant Pathology at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road. This centre is a testament to his dedication and expertise and has helped countless patients receive the best possible care for their renal and transplant-related diseases. He is the foremost&nbsp;Pathologist in Old Airport Road, Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Mahesha Vankalakunti completed his MBBS from Karnataka Medical College in Hubli. He advanced his medical learning by earning an MD in Pathology from the esteemed Postgraduate Institute of Medical Education and Research, (PGIMER) Chandigarh. Dr. Vankalakunti&#39;s passion for specialised knowledge in these crucial areas prompted him to undertake a 1-Year long Post-Doctoral Certificate Course (PDCC) in Renal &amp; Transplant Pathology at PGIMER, Chandigarh.&nbsp;

Dr. Vankalakunti also completed a Clinical Nephropathology Certificate Course, ISN-ANIO Program, and a Fellowship in Medical Renal, Transplant Disease, and Urologic Pathology at Sinai Medical Centre, Los Angeles, USA. These certificates highlight his ability to deal with difficult situations involving renal and transplant pathology, indicating his dedication to providing high-quality medical treatment.

Being an Executive Member of the Indian Society of Renal &amp; Transplant Pathology Society (ISRTP), Dr. Mahesha Vankalakunti helps the group flourish and promotes the exchange of professional knowledge. In addition, he belongs to several national societies, such as the Indian Association Of Pathologists &amp; Microbiologists (IAPM), Karnataka Chapter- Indian Association of Pathologists and Microbiologists (KC-IAPM), International Academy of Pathology - Indian Division (IAP-ID), and International Sleep Research Training Program (ISRTP). He also has memberships in esteemed organisations like the International Society of Nephrology (ISN) and the Renal Pathology Society (RPS).&nbsp;

Dr. Mahesha Vankalakunti is a capable and significant member of the global nephrology community, as evidenced by his involvement as a CME-sponsored Speaker for ISN programs. He is dedicated to furthering medical knowledge, participating in global forums, and contributing to professional associations.

Dr C Shivaram is a highly skilled Transfusion Medicine specialist at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bangalore. Transfusion Medicine and Pathology are the two fields where he has excelled in his career. Dr. C Shivaram has been a pioneer of many advancements in his field. He was the first to begin HCV screening in Karnataka. Not only that, in 2005, he also started an in-house Non-accidental trauma (NAT) centre for the first time in the state and a Thalassemia Transfusion Center, where he provides free transfusions to patients. This was yet another major breakthrough in the field of Transfusion Medicine and helped improve the quality of patient care in the state. Dr. Shivaram was also the first person to perform Apheresis and Peripheral Stem Cell Transplantation in Karnataka. He is the foremost&nbsp;Consultant Transfusion Medicine in Oldairportroad, Bangalore.

After an MBBS from Mysore Medical College &amp; Research Institute, Dr. Shivaram pursued a Diploma in Clinical Pathology (DCP) from Bangalore Medical College and Research Institute. He also completed a Master of Healthcare Administration degree from the Institute of Chartered Financial Analysts of India (ICFAI). &nbsp;

As a renowned author, Dr. C Shivaram has authored and co-authored many textbooks, chapters, research papers, and articles in journals and online media. He authored a textbook called &quot;Transfusion Medicine for Clinicians&quot;. He has co-authored chapters for many publications including - Massive Blood Transfusions for Obstetricians and Anemia in Pregnancy - BSOG Publication. He was also nominated as Editor-in-chief of the Global Journal of Transfusion Medicine by AATM in 2015.&nbsp;

