MBBS Training: Dr Shivakumar Shamarao has completed his MBBS from Sri Devraj Urs Medical College and Research Centre under the auspices of Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences. He secured a Gold Medal in Pathology during his MBBS training.&nbsp;

