Dr. Shilpa Shetty is a top nephrologist in Bangalore and is currently a Consultant - Nephrology at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road. With over 12 years of profound experience in the field of nephrology, Dr. Shilpa&#39;s exceptional expertise lies in performing diagnostic and therapeutic treatments for kidney ailments such as kidney biopsies, central line placements, chronic kidney diseases, renal placement therapies, dialysis, haemodialysis, peritoneal dialysis, CAPT, and renal transplantations. She is a&nbsp;Top Nephrologist in Bangalore.

Dr. Shilpa Shetty completed her MBBS from Kasturba Medical College in 1992 and later completed her MD in General Medicine in 1997. She also earned a Fellowship in Nephrology from Manipal Hospital in Bangalore in 2001. She has also co-authored a case report on &quot;Medullary Nephrocalcinosis&quot; that was published in the Indian Journal of Kidney Diseases. She actively participates in both national and international conferences in her field of nephrology regularly and keeps abreast of all the advancements in her field. Her professionalism and calm demeanour complement her patient-centric approach with which she handles her patients&#39; care and treatment.&nbsp;

Dr. Shetty is active in the medical community as a lifetime member of the Indian Society of Nephrology (ISN), Nephrology Association of Karnataka (NAK), and Research Society for the Study of Diabetes in India (RSSDI). She is dedicated to staying at the forefront of advancements in nephrological care which is evidenced through her active participation in national and international conferences. Her extensive experience in the field of nephrology is complimented by her dedication to furthering her knowledge and staying abreast of the latest advancements in nephrology. Patients seeking specialised care in nephrology can rest assured that they will be provided with the highest standards of treatment by Dr. Shilpa Shetty.

Dr. Satyanarayana Mysore is an accomplished specialist with practical experience in Pulmonology and Lung Transplantation. He is currently the HOD (Head of the Department) and Consultant in Pulmonology at Manipal Hospital, Old Airport Road. His commitment to providing patients with the utmost care and clinical teaching has earned him recognition and numerous awards throughout his career. Dr. Mysore also has an impressive educational background. He received his MBBS degree, which he obtained during his undergraduate studies. He pursued his postgraduate education and obtained a DNB (Diplomate of National Board) in Internal Medicine. Dr. Mysore also holds the prestigious FRACP (Fellow of the Royal Australasian College of Physicians) qualification from Australia. In addition to these qualifications, he is a fellow of the American College of Chest Physicians (FCCP) and the American College of Physicians (FACP). His diverse qualifications showcase his dedication to continuous learning and professional growth.

As a Pulmonology trained professional, Dr. Satyanarayana Mysore has expertise in different areas of respiratory medication. His main subject area focuses on diagnosing and managing airway diseases like Asthma and COPD (Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease), interstitial lung infections, pneumonic hypertension, rare lung diseases, respiratory diseases like tuberculosis (TB), and drug-resistant TB. Additionally, he has extensive experience detecting and staging lung malignancies, home therapy, and various forms of pulmonary rehabilitation. Dr. Mysore is the best pulmonologist in Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Mysore is also interested in sleep medicine and is skilled in identifying and treating sleep difficulties such as obstructive sleep apnea (OSA), insomnia, irregular circadian rhythms, and restless leg syndrome. He is familiar with popular rest assessment tools, including the Multiple Sleep Latency Test (MSLT) and the Proposed Immobilisation Test. Dr. Satyanarayana Mysore is also skilled in interventional pulmonology procedures. He is trained in image-guided transbronchial lung biopsy, endobronchial ultrasound (EBUS), advanced video bronchoscopic interventions, and medical thoracoscopy. These procedures enable him to diagnose and treat various lung conditions using minimally invasive techniques. He is well-versed in three languages Kannada, English, and Hindi. This multilingual ability helps him to communicate effectively with patients from diverse backgrounds, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of their medical concerns.

Dr. Mysore has actively participated in various talks and published numerous articles on topics related to his expertise. His contributions cover subjects such as respiratory infections, COVID-19 treatment, lung health, and the impact of the pandemic on lung function. These articles and talks demonstrate his dedication to educating the medical community and the general public about crucial respiratory health issues.

Dr. Satyanarayana Mysore has been honoured with the prestigious Karnataka Rajyotsava Award 2024 for his outstanding contributions to the field of medicine. The Karnataka Rajyotsava Award is one of the highest civilian awards in the state, presented annually by the Government of Karnataka on Kannada Rajyotsava, celebrated on November 1. This award recognizes individuals who have made significant impacts across various domains, and Dr. Satyanarayana&rsquo;s dedication and service have set a remarkable example in healthcare.&nbsp;

Dr. Sadasivan S. Iyer is a well-known Anaesthesia and Pain Management consultant in Bangalore currently associated with Manipal Hospitals, Old Airport Road. His notable accomplishments include a Fellowship in Pain Management from the prestigious Singapore General Hospital and membership in the Indian Academy of Pain Medicine. He is also a founding member of the Society of Integrated Pain and Palliative Care member.

Dr. Iyer has an MBBS degree, an MD in Anaesthesiology and an Indian Diploma In Regional Anaesthesia. His zeal for knowledge and desire to make a substantial difference in patients&#39; lives pushed him to pursue more specialisation in pain treatment. This drove him to get a Fellowship in Pain Management from Singapore General Hospital. Dr. Iyer is also a member of the Indian Society for the Study of Pain, the Indian Society of Anaesthesiologists, the Academy of Regional Anaesthesia, and the Indian College of Anaesthesiologists. He can speak English, Hindi, Tamil, Kannada and Telugu, making him reachable to many patients. Dr. Iyer is a foremost pain medicine expert in Old Airport Road Bangalore.

Dr. Iyer has expertise in cancer pain management, palliative care, interventional pain management, chronic pain management, and regional anaesthesia. He assures patients&#39; comfort and well-being throughout surgical operations and efficiently treats their pain afterwards. Dr. Sadasivan S. Iyer has much experience in anaesthesia and pain management. He is committed to providing the best possible care for his patients and strives to improve their quality of life.&nbsp;

Dr. Sadasivan S. Iyer&#39;s article is a prospective randomised trial that compared transversus abdominis plane analgesia to epidural analgesia for postoperative pain management in individuals after lower abdominal surgery. This study gave valuable insights into pain treatment, influenced future efforts to improve patient comfort and rehabilitation, and inspired fellow practitioners to explore new possibilities in their practice. He has authored various research articles and presentations, including research on using buprenorphine and dexmedetomidine as spinal anaesthetic supplements in older men undergoing prostate surgery.&nbsp;

Dr. Iyer&#39;s commitment to improving patient lives and expanding pain treatment approaches has garnered him invitations to national, international, and state-level conferences. He offers his knowledge and experiences through captivating presentations, helping progress pain treatment practices globally. Dr. Iyer handles each case with thorough attention and a personalised treatment strategy, having an in-depth understanding of the complexity of pain and its influence on patients&#39; lives. He believes in a comprehensive approach to pain management that incorporates medical therapies and interdisciplinary approaches. Dr. Iyer&#39;s relentless commitment to his patients makes him vital to the medical community.

Dr. Hemanth G N is one of the best Surgical Oncologists and Robotic Surgeons in Bangalore with over 12+ years of specialized experience in the field. He is currently practicing as a Consultant - Surgical Oncology &amp; Robotic Surgery at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road. In his clinical practice, Dr. Hemanth specializes in Robotic and Laparoscopic Surgery for various cancers, including Thoracic, Upper Gastrointestinal, Intestinal, and Colorectal Cancers. He is the&nbsp;Best Onco Surgeon in Bangalore.

Beginning his medical journey with an MBBS from J.J.M. Medical College, Davangere (RGUHS), Bangalore in 2007, Dr. Hemanth G N pursued MS - General Surgery from Gauhati Medical College, Assam in 2011 and MCh - Surgical Oncology at the prestigious St. John&rsquo;s Medical College Hospital, Bangalore in 2016. Dr. Hemanth has undergone further specialized training in Advanced Laparoscopic Upper GI Surgery at Seoul National University Hospital (SNUH), in Seoul, South Korea. He is trained in Advanced Peritonectomy and Management of Peritoneal Surface Malignancy by the European Society of Surgical Oncology (ESSO).&nbsp;

Dr. Hemanth G N is proficient in advanced oncological procedures, like Cytoreductive Surgery (CRS), HIPEC(Hyperthermic Intraperitoneal Chemotherapy), and Breast Conservation Surgery. His expertise extends to Sentinel Lymph Node Surgery for Breast and Uterine Cancer and various Oral, Head, and Neck Cancer Surgeries. Dr. Hemanth has undergone specialized training in thoracic surgery for Uniportal Video-Assisted Thoracoscopic surgery (VATS) at the Fondazinone Policlinico Universitario Agostino Gemelli IRCCS, Rome, Italy. He is also trained in a highly specialized procedure called PIPAC (Pressurised intraperitoneal aerosol chemotherapy), used for advanced peritoneal surface malignancy, at the National University Hospital, Singapore.&nbsp;

Dr. Hemanth G N has recently been inducted into the European Board of Surgery as a Fellow of the European Board of Surgery in Surgical Oncology and has since been a part of the European Society of Surgical Oncology. He has a strong academic inclination and has won many prestigious accolades like the &lsquo;Dr. Mahadevan Award for Surgical Excellence&rsquo; during the Karnataka State Surgeons Conference in February 2016.&nbsp;

With over 10 publications in peer-reviewed journals, Dr. Hemanth G N is a reviewer of academic research and recent advances in oncology in various prestigious journals including the Indian Journal of Surgical Oncology (IJSO). He has pioneered a new technique to reduce delayed gastric emptying (DGE) which commonly occurs after a complex surgery in gastrointestinal oncology called Whipple&rsquo;s Pancreaticoduodenectomy, the surgery considered to be the pinnacle of surgical acumen. &nbsp;Through his dedication to advancing cancer care and patient-centred cancer care, Dr. Hemanth is a top surgical oncologist in Bangalore, making huge contributions to surgical oncology.

Dr. Mohammed Shahid Ali is a widely respected Urologist and Robotic Surgeon in Bangalore. As a Consultant - Uro-Oncology Robotic Surgery And Renal Transplantation at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Dr. Ali manages a wide range of urological issues involving the kidneys, bladder, and urinary tract as well as cancers of these organs, with a focus on minimally invasive approach whenever possible. He excels in performing endoscopic, laparoscopic, and robotic urological procedures like Laser TURP, RIRS, &nbsp;Kidney Transplants, Nephrectomy, Partial nephrectomy, Urethral Reconstruction, Prostatectomy, Fistula Repair, Mini PCNL, Pyeloplasty, Ureteric Re-implantation, as well as Robotic Uro-oncology procedures. He is the&nbsp;Best Urologist in Old Airport Road.

With an impressive academic background, Dr. Mohammed Shahid Ali&#39;s medical journey began with an MBBS, followed by an MS in Surgery, and a DNB (Doctorate in National Board) - Urology. He is also a Vatikutti Henry Ford fellow in Robotic urology, Uro oncology, and Renal transplantation. His interest in robotic surgery has given him an edge in the field of ever-evolving healthcare, showcasing his dedication to improving patient care in the realm of urological care.&nbsp;

Dr. Mohammed Shahid Ali&#39;s active involvement in research underscores his commitment to advancing urological care and surgical techniques. He is involved in the urology community and holds memberships in prestigious organizations including the Urological Society of India, South Zone USI, Karnataka Urology Association, and Bangalore and Mysore Urology Associations. He is an active speaker at conferences and health sessions, providing invaluable insights on urological care. Dr. Ali&#39;s video demonstration of &lsquo;Robotic-assisted right radical nephrectomy with IVC thrombectomy&rsquo; won the NU Trust Best Video award at KUACON 2022.&nbsp;

Dr. Ali also earned runner&#39;s place in the surgical quiz &ndash; conducted by the Surgical Society of Bangalore. His talks and articles on topics such as &#39;Comprehensive Insights on Kidney Care from the Manipal Health Symposium&#39; and &#39;Penis can break while making a relationship, know from experts the cause, symptoms and treatment of penile fracture&#39; are featured in various newspapers. For his contribution to the world of healthcare, especially urology, Dr. Mohammed Shahid Ali is regarded as one of the best urologists and uro-oncologists in Bangalore.

Dr. Aditi Chopra, an accomplished medical professional in endocrinology as well as diabetes, boasts an extensive experience of over 13 years. She is a valued medical staff member at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road in Bangalore. With a specialised focus on thyroid &amp; diabetes-related ailments across all age groups, she possesses exceptional skills in diagnosing and treating endocrine disorders in both adult and pediatric patients. Renowned for her meticulous attention to detail, accurate diagnoses, and empathetic approach towards patient care, Dr. Chopra has consistently demonstrated her expertise in managing numerous challenging medical scenarios. Dr. Chopra exhibits a broad range of proficiency, encompassing various critical conditions and a diverse range of subjects within her field. She is the foremost&nbsp;endocrinologist in Old Airport Road, Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Chopra possesses a wealth of expertise and a comprehensive comprehension of various disciplines within her field, enabling her to provide comprehensive and effective treatment alternatives to her patients. Her areas of focus encompass osteoporosis, metabolic disorders affecting the bones, disorders related to growth and puberty, polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS), ailments affecting the pituitary and adrenal glands, as well as thyroid disorders. Juvenile diabetes is a specific area of attention for her. With such a wide range of knowledge, she can create comprehensive and effective treatment plans for those seeking her care. Having obtained her MBBS degree, Dr. Chopra pursued her academic endeavours, obtaining an MD degree followed by a DM in Endocrinology. No wonder she is a foremost endocrinologist in Old Airport Road, Bangalore.

These successes demonstrate her dedication to lifelong learning and keeping up with the most recent developments in her area, ensuring that her patients receive the most current and research-based care possible. Dr. Chopra has received several important accolades in honour of her unrelenting commitment and accomplishments in the medical field. Her ground-breaking project, &quot;Clinical Characteristics, Localisation, and Following up with the Patients of Tumor-induced Osteomalacia (TIO),&quot; earned a research grant from the Endocrine Society of India. Additionally, she was granted a travel allowance to participate in the Endocrine Fellows Foundation/ASBMR 2016 event held in Atlanta, USA, further showcasing her commitment to academic excellence and professional development. Dr. Chopra has authored many articles and academic works that have received praise from critics. Her discoveries and contributions to medical knowledge have improved patient treatment and increased knowledge of endocrine problems. Patients who seek the expertise of Dr. Aditi Chopra can expect to receive comprehensive and compassionate care from a highly skilled and dedicated professional. With her exceptional knowledge, meticulous approach, and esteemed reputation, she continues to make a significant difference in the lives of individuals grappling with endocrine and diabetes-related challenges.

Dr. Neha Mishra is a popular infectious diseases consultant based in Bangalore. She is associated with the Manipal Hospital located at Whitefield, Bangalore. She has an experience of over 13 years in her field. She is an expert in treating upper and lower respiratory tract infections, fevers of unknown origin, post-surgical infections, HIV and associated illnesses, etc. She has worked to spread awareness among people about using antibiotics correctly in daily practice. This is called encouraging antimicrobial stewardship. Dr. Mishra completed her MBBS in 2004 from the Kamineri Institute of Health Sciences located in Telangana. Later she pursued her MD in Internal Medicine from MMU, Haryana, in 2010 and then in General Medicine from Maharishi Markandeshwar Institute Of Medical Sciences &amp; Research, Ambala, in 2013. Dr. Mishra has a post-doctoral fellowship in infectious diseases, which she completed at the Christian Medical College in Vellore. She also completed her post-graduation diploma in infectious diseases. She completed it at the University of New South Wales and Medvarsity. For the same reasons, she is a highly preferred&nbsp;infectious disease doctor Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Mishra has worked on treating urinary tract infections, respiratory tract infections, abdominal infections, skull-based infections, and others by giving the correct antibiotics. She has treated dengue, chikungunya, malaria, and other tropical infections successfully. She has treated pulmonary and extrapulmonary tuberculosis, bone marrow infections, solid organ transplant infections, complex bacterial infections, etc during her career. She has worked on treating patients with infections to immunocompromised patients. This includes HIV patients and infections that happen after transplants. She is a member of reputed societies like the Clinical Infectious Diseases Society, UP-Diabetes Association, and the Asia Pacific Travel Health Society.

Dr. Neha Mishra has presented her papers multiple times at different conventions across the world. Her articles have been published in newspapers like Daily Hunt, Hindustan Times, Bangalore Mirror, Indian Express, and many others. She wrote articles and appeared for interviews during the COVID-19 pandemic to help people navigate the crisis. She has written on topics like COVID-19 vaccines, new COVID strains, cancer, HIV, tuberculosis, and the rise in flu cases. She has participated in a panel to discuss &#39;Vaccination Beyond Childhood&#39; supported by Pfizer. Dr. Mishra has been trained by the pioneers of the program for infectious diseases during her time at the Christian Medical College. She has been a teaching faculty at the same college for the fellowship in general infectious diseases. Dr. Neha Mishra has written for different national and international journals and publications. She has worked with Delhi University&#39;s University College of Medical Science for three years. She was also an Assistant Professor at Sharda University. She speaks languages like English, Hindi, Telugu, and Bengali.

Dr. Archana M is a dedicated Consultant - Paediatric Infectious Diseases at Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bangalore. With a career spanning 15+ years, she has expertise in handling infections that kids might get while staying in hospitals (hospital-acquired infections), tropical Infections, infections in immunodeficient and immunocompromised patients, diseases like TB, HIV/AIDS, and preventing infections from spreading. She is also known for handling difficult cases, like when kids have weak defences against illnesses and suffer from prolonged fevers or need to use antibiotics with care. The doctor is also skilled at offering immunization to children in special situations or for travel purposes and works towards infection control for little kids. For her commitment to providing the best level of care, Dr. Archana M is widely regarded as the foremost Children Infectious Disease Doctor in Old Airport Road

Dr. Archana&#39;s academic journey includes prestigious stints, such as MBBS from Kempegowda Institute Of Medical Sciences, Bangalore, India, and DNB in Paediatrics from Masonic Medical Centre For Children (Trust Hospital), Coimbatore, India. She has also undergone a two-year training under pioneers in Paediatric Infectious Diseases at the University of Oxford, London. Dr. Archana has also completed her Fellowship In Paediatric Infectious Diseases (IAP) from Manipal Hospital Old Airport Road, Bangalore, India. Her pursuit of excellence led her to various certifications like &quot;Wiser Immunisers: Vaccination Course For Health Professionals&quot; and &quot;Antibiotic Management Course&quot; by ESPID.&nbsp;

Dr. Archana M also holds an &quot;Advanced Certificate in Infection Prevention and Control&quot; from Apollo Medvarsity and has achieved Provider-level certifications in Basic and Advanced Life Support for children. Her contributions to medical research are noteworthy, having served as a co-investigator for a Pfizer clinical trial focused on the safety of a pneumococcal vaccine in children. She&#39;s been recognized for her papers and posters presented at national and international conferences like ESPID, WSPID, and the Coalition against Typhoid.&nbsp;

Dr. Archana&#39;s commitment to teaching and making medical knowledge better show up in her speeches, writing, and involvement with groups that handle doctors&#39; stuff, like the Indian Medical Association (IMA), the Indian Academy of Pediatrics, or a professional group called ESPID. She has made it a goal to improve the prevention and treatment of Paediatric Infectious Diseases. She has also been contributing to her time to create awareness of these diseases in schools and other hospitals.

Dr. Srimanth B S is the best orthopedic oncology surgeon in Sarjapur Road specialising in the diagnosis and treatment of musculoskeletal tumours. With a focus on primary bone and soft tissue tumours as well as metastatic bone disease, Dr. Srimanth is dedicated to providing comprehensive care to his patients. Having obtained a degree in orthopaedics, Dr. Srimanth further honed his skills in the field of orthopaedic oncology through extensive training at prestigious national and international centres of excellence. He completed his specialization at the Tata Memorial Hospital in Mumbai, renowned for its expertise in cancer care. Additionally, he gained valuable insights and experience at the Rizzoli Orthopaedic Institute in Italy and Seoul National University in South Korea.

