Dr. Mohammed Shahid Ali is a widely respected Urologist and Robotic Surgeon in Bangalore. As a Consultant - Uro-Oncology Robotic Surgery and Renal Transplantation at Manipal Clinic Indiranagar, Dr. Ali manages a wide range of urological issues involving the kidneys, bladder, and urinary tract as well as cancers of these organs, with a focus on a minimally invasive approach whenever possible. He excels in performing endoscopic, laparoscopic, and robotic urological procedures like Laser TURP, RIRS, &nbsp;Kidney Transplants, Nephrectomy, Partial nephrectomy, Urethral Reconstruction, Prostatectomy, Fistula Repair, Mini PCNL, Pyeloplasty, Ureteric Re-implantation, as well as Robotic Uro-oncology procedures. He is the&nbsp;Best Urologist in Old Airport Road.

