Dr. Hemanandini Jayaraman is a renowned Gynaecologist in Bengaluru who is currently serving as a Consultant - Obstetrics &amp; Gynaecology at Manipal Hospitals, Clinic Indiranagar, Bengaluru. She has a rich experience of more than 2 decades in Obstetrics and Gynaecology. Her area of expertise lies in Laparoscopic surgery, High-risk obstetrics, Robotic surgeries, and Vaginal hysterectomy. She specialises in performing vaginal hysterectomies and handling high-risk pregnancies. She is the Best Obstetrician &amp; Gynaecologist in Clinic Indiranagar, Bangalore.

