Dr. Neha Mohan Rao completed her MBBS from JSS Medical College, Mysore and won the gold medal for Pediatrics in her final year MBBS. She then pursued her Diploma in Child Health (DCH) at St John&rsquo;s Medical College and Hospital, Bangalore, and stood second in Karnataka state in DCH exams. Subsequently, she completed her DNB in paediatrics from Bangalore Baptist Hospital. She stood first nationally in her DNB exams and secured the gold medal in paediatrics.

Dr. Neha then completed a two-year fellowship program in Pediatric Pulmonology. The first two years of training took place at Bharati Vidyapeeth Medical College and Hospital, Pune followed by a second year of training at Birmingham Children&rsquo;s Hospital, Birmingham, UK. She is the best pediatric pulmonologist in Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Neha&rsquo;s expertise includes pediatric allergy and asthma, Cystic Fibrosis, pediatric chronic lung diseases and pediatric sleep medicine. She is trained to perform procedures like pediatric lung function tests, neonatal and pediatric flexible bronchoscopy, polysomnography and skin prick tests. She has also secured the European Respiratory Society Diplomate in Pediatric Respiratory Medicine in 2022. She has completed a formal certificate course in allergy and asthma (Asthma Allergy Specialist Course) certified by Bharati Vidyapeeth University, Pune and the International Asthma Services, Colorado, USA, in 2021. She is the best pediatric pulmonologist in Bangalore.

In addition to pediatric Pulmonology, Dr. Neha&rsquo;s other areas of interest include pediatric ethics. She completed a formal certificate program in pediatric bioethics from the Children&rsquo;s Mercy Hospital, Kansas City, USA in 2022. In addition, she has contributed to creating the Indian Academy of Pediatrics module on ethics in 2022. Dr. Neha has also completed a course on clinical research methods from the Indian Institute of Public Health, New Delhi in 2020, and has presented several posters and papers at various national and international conferences. She is also passionate about teaching undergraduate and postgraduate students.&nbsp;

Dr. Abhishek Soni is an top&nbsp;experienced medical professional who is currently practising as a Consultant - Spine Care, at Manipal Clinics in Indiranagar, Bangalore. He is a well-respected surgeon known for his dedication to patient care, empathetic approach, and meticulousness. Dr. Soni has been a precious asset in the medical community since the beginning of his profession. He started his medical career by completing his MBBS from BJ Medical College, and then he pursued his MS in Orthopaedics from the Civil Hospital, Ahmedabad. It was during the initial phase of his medical education that he showed a keen interest in the intricacies of spine surgery. This passion allowed him to pursue a specialised FNB Fellowship in Spine Surgery at Manipal Hospitals, Bangalore. Such expert exposure and elaborate academic background have positioned Dr. Abhishek Soni as one of the most knowledgeable spine surgeons in Bangalore. Therefore, he is regarded as a&nbsp;top spine surgeon in Bangalore.

Dr. Abhishek Soni specialises in different aspects of Spine Care. This includes minimally invasive spinal surgery, disc herniations, degenerative disc diseases, spinal deformities, spinal tumours, robotic-assisted spine surgery, spine infection and tuberculosis, revision spine surgery, spinal fusions, non-operative care, vertebroplasty, and kyphoplasty. His expertise extends to deformity correction surgeries and non-operative management, too. Dr. Soni is not just a professional expert but also a kind human being. He makes sure that his patients feel at ease during the entire treatment procedure, including post-operative care. Dr. Abhishek Soni aims to reduce the complications as much as possible with a thorough follow-up plan. This exclusive approach makes him one of the best spine surgeons in Bangalore.

The sheer importance of accurate communication in the medical world can never be understated. With that in mind, Dr. Abhishek has elevated his communication skills to the best possible level. He is highly compassionate and kind towards his patients, explaining every minute detail of spine care to them in the easiest way. Besides, he is multilingual and can fluently speak English, Hindi, Bengali, Urdu, and Kannada which helps him connect with his patients and hold a knowledgeable communication with his patients without the constraints of regional and linguistic barriers. Moreover, Dr. Abhishek Soni has gained extensive expertise in managing a wide spectrum of spine ailments and surgeries during his fellowship programme. He is motivated to extend his expertise in providing quality treatment with the help of technology. All of these aspects, combined with his keen judgement and accurate diagnosis, make Dr. Abhishek Soni a well-recognised and respected spine surgeon.&nbsp;

Dr. Aditi Chopra, an accomplished medical professional in endocrinology as well as diabetes, boasts an extensive experience of over 13 years. She is a valued medical staff member at Manipal Clinic Indiranagar&nbsp;in Bangalore. With a specialised focus on thyroid &amp; diabetes-related ailments across all age groups, she possesses exceptional skills in diagnosing and treating endocrine disorders in both adult and pediatric patients. Renowned for her meticulous attention to detail, accurate diagnoses, and empathetic approach towards patient care, Dr. Chopra has consistently demonstrated her expertise in managing numerous challenging medical scenarios. Dr. Chopra exhibits a broad range of proficiency, encompassing various critical conditions and a diverse range of subjects within her field. She is the foremost&nbsp;endocrinologist in Clinic Indiranagar, Bangalore.&nbsp;

Dr. Chopra possesses a wealth of expertise and a comprehensive comprehension of various disciplines within her field, enabling her to provide comprehensive and effective treatment alternatives to her patients. Her areas of focus encompass osteoporosis, metabolic disorders affecting the bones, disorders related to growth and puberty, polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS), ailments affecting the pituitary and adrenal glands, as well as thyroid disorders. Juvenile diabetes is a specific area of attention for her. With such a wide range of knowledge, she can create comprehensive and effective treatment plans for those seeking her care. Having obtained her MBBS degree, Dr. Chopra pursued her academic endeavours, obtaining an MD degree followed by a DM in Endocrinology. No wonder she is a foremost endocrinologist in Clinic Indiranagar, Bangalore.

These successes demonstrate her dedication to lifelong learning and keeping up with the most recent developments in her area, ensuring that her patients receive the most current and research-based care possible. Dr. Chopra has received several important accolades in honour of her unrelenting commitment and accomplishments in the medical field. Her ground-breaking project, &quot;Clinical Characteristics, Localisation, and Following up with the Patients of Tumor-induced Osteomalacia (TIO),&quot; earned a research grant from the Endocrine Society of India. Additionally, she was granted a travel allowance to participate in the Endocrine Fellows Foundation/ASBMR 2016 event held in Atlanta, USA, further showcasing her commitment to academic excellence and professional development. Dr. Chopra has authored many articles and academic works that have received praise from critics. Her discoveries and contributions to medical knowledge have improved patient treatment and increased knowledge of endocrine problems. Patients who seek the expertise of Dr. Aditi Chopra can expect to receive comprehensive and compassionate care from a highly skilled and dedicated professional. With her exceptional knowledge, meticulous approach, and esteemed reputation, she continues to make a significant difference in the lives of individuals grappling with endocrine and diabetes-related challenges.

Dr. Rao did his Masters at Kasturba Medical College, Mangalore (Manipal University) bagging the best outgoing student in the process. He is a Fellow of the European Board of Examinations and the European Academy of Otology &amp; Neurotology. He was awarded the British Annual Congress in Otolaryngology (BACO) fellowship, the Birla Smarak Kosh Fellowship &amp; the GSE fellowship of Rotary International, and the Ten Outstanding Indians Award from Junior Chamber International (JCI). &nbsp;He is an Adjunct Professor at KMC Mangalore, MAHE, and a Visiting Professor at Jiao Tong University, Shanghai, China.&nbsp;

He completed his 2-year fellowship in Skull Base Surgeries &amp; Hearing Implantology at the Skull Base unit of Casa Di Cura Piacenza (Italy) &amp; was awarded a Fellowship from the European Academy of Neurotology (EAONO). He continued to work in Italy with legendary Skull Base Surgeons like Mario Sanna, Jacques Magnan and Paolo Castelnuovo for a total of six and a half years accumulating vast experience in Skull Base Surgery. Dr. Rao has over 150 peer-reviewed scientific publications, 40 chapters in various textbooks &amp; is the author of 3 textbooks. Dr. Rao was awarded an honorary Fellow of the American College of Surgeons (FACS) in 2019, and a visiting Professorship to the Shanghai Jiao Tong University, one of Asia&#39;s largest Universities. He is the recipient of multiple professional and civilian awards. He is an invited faculty at most major Skull Base, Neurosurgery and ENT events across the world and has delivered several Orations in India and abroad.&nbsp;

He has pioneered many new concepts in skull base surgery in India and through his private companies, is keenly involved in the R&amp;D of Robotic Technology, VR/AR integration into surgery and training events. He is the Founder of the World Skull Base Foundation (Section 8 NGO) &amp; the WSB Fellowship Diplomas in Skull Base Surgery offered in Bangalore, which are the 1st curriculum-based skull base courses in India that are awarded a University Diploma. Dr. Rao is a member of the Govt of Karnataka COVID Task Force &amp; Sub Committee on Mucormycosis. He also runs a charity for poor patients with diseases of the Head, Neck, Skull Base &amp; Hearing. He works at Manipal Clinics Bangalore, a state-of-the-art Multispecialty hospital and heads the Skull Base and Hearing Implantology unit.

Dr. Roshan Uthappa is an experienced endodontist and restorative dentist in Bangalore with over 25 years of dedicated experience in the field of dentistry, specialising in Endodontics. He is currently practising as a Consultant - Endodontist at Manipal Clinic Indiranagar. With a rich academic background and a strong clinical foundation, Dr. Roshan has consistently demonstrated a commitment to excellence, patient care, and the advancement of dental education and practice.&nbsp;

Dr. Roshan commenced his academic journey in dentistry with a Bachelor of Dental Surgery from the University of Mysore, graduating in 1993. Driven by a profound interest in restorative dental sciences and a passion for precision, he further pursued a post-graduation degree in Endodontics at Bangalore University, completing the programme in 1998. His academic training laid a strong foundation for a career marked by both clinical mastery and scholarly contribution.

Dr. Roshan is known for his expertise in Endodontics where he continually kept pace with emerging technologies, materials, and methodologies. He is proficient in single-visit root canal treatments, re-treatment of failed endodontic cases, fractured tooth reattachment, and aesthetic dental corrections. His meticulous approach ensures high treatment success rates while maintaining patient comfort and satisfaction. Every procedure is rooted in evidence-based dentistry and customised for each patient&#39;s needs.

Over the course of his professional life, Dr. Roshan has amassed a diverse and enriching experience, having served in various esteemed institutions across India and abroad. These roles not only involved mentoring undergraduate and postgraduate students, but also contributed actively to the development and management of the departments he was associated with.&nbsp;

Dr. Roshan combines technical excellence with a deep commitment to patient well-being. His thorough and informative consultations empower patients with clear explanations and collaborative treatment planning. Patients consistently appreciate his gentle demeanour, attention to detail, and the confidence he brings to complex dental procedures. His journey reflects a lifelong dedication to the profession, as he continues to seek new challenges and opportunities that further enrich his professional journey.&nbsp;

Beyond his clinical expertise, Dr. Roshan is valued for his interpersonal skills and compassionate patient interactions. He speaks English, Hindi, Kannada, Telugu, Tamil, Malayalam, Kodava, and Arabic. His multilingual proficiency allows him to build meaningful relationships with patients from diverse backgrounds, ensuring clear communication and a welcoming environment.
